Subject: [PATCH] docs(memory): design spec for query-relevant injection ranker
 (a5ecc5aa)

Keystone fix for the scope-as-ranker defect: thread the turn query into
retrieveForContext, rank the scope-filtered pool by ts_rank (FTS), demote
scope-specificity and recency to bounded multipliers. FTS-first with a
shipped zero-hit metric as the embeddings trigger. No migration.

